      50.35,
      643.09,
      245.96,
      654.16
    ],
    "text": "(C \u2013 Comply with Safety Measures / Standards)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      50.35,
      667.09,
      215.36,
      678.16
    ],
    "text": "4. For the purpose of these Regulations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      59.95,
      691.09,
      537.93,
      726.16
    ],
    "text": "(a)Importation of brand new motor vehicles, classifiable under the HS Chapter 87 shall carry a manufacturer\u2019scertificate issued by the manufacturer of such motor vehicles to the effect that the motor vehicles comply withthe Vehicular Exhaust Emissions Standards and Safety Measures / Standards referred to above.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      85.77,
      85.09,
      546.81,
      106.41
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'01'25PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 25.01.20195A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabld,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      64.17,
      122.05,
      547.25,
      181.12
    ],
    "text": "(b)Importation of all motor vehicles other than brand new motor vehicles referred to in (a) above or a supplieris unable to produce a Manufacture Certificate for importation of a brand new vehicle, shall carry a Pre-shipmentInspection Certificate issued by Authorized Inspection Agencies appointed by the Gazette (Extraordinary)No.1804/17 dated 03rd April 2013 as amended from time to time to the effect that the motor vehicles comply withthe Vehicular Exhaust Emissions Standards and Safety Measures / Standards referred to above.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.800000190734863,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      64.17,
      194.05,
      547.28,
      229.12
    ],
    "text": "(c)In case the certificates furnished by manufacturer or authorized inspection agency are found to be containing falseinformation contradicting the objective of these regulations, the Controller General shall consider to take legalaction against such parties.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      64.17,
      242.05,
      547.24,
      265.12
    ],
    "text": "(d)In case the importer is found to have furnished a forged Certificate, contradicting the objective of these regulations,the Controller General shall consider to take legal action against such party.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      278.05,
      547.26,
      301.12
    ],
    "text": "5. Manufacturer Certificate and Pre-shipment Inspection Certificate should be directly sent by the beneficiary/negotiating bank to the Local bank where the valid Letters of Credit (L/C\u2019s) were opened.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      314.05,
      547.27,
      361.12
    ],
    "text": "6. Importation of motor vehicles, classifiable under the Chapter 87 of the Harmonized Description and CodingSystem shall only be made by Letters of Credit (LCs), which shall be established prior to shipment of such motorvehicles.The Emissions Standards and Safety Measures / Standards, specified in these regulations shall be included in theLetters of Credit as mandatory requirements to be complied with in importation of such motor vehicles.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      374.05,
      547.12,
      397.12
    ],
    "text": "7. The motor vehicles which do not comply with the said Vehicular Exhaust Emissions Standards and SafetyMeasures / Standards shall be re-exported by the importer(s) at his own cost.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      410.05,
      547.27,
      433.12
    ],
    "text": "8. Compliance with Vehicular Exhaust Emission Limits and Safety Measures / Standards shall not be required forVintage Vehicles manufactured prior to 30th November 1956.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.800000190734863,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      446.05,
      547.23,
      481.12
    ],
    "text": "9. In the event of any issues arisen with regard to the applicability of the above regulations to any person orconsignment, Controller General of Department of Imports and Exports (Control) may, at his discretion reserve the finaldecision on applicability of regulations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      494.05,
      82.77,
      505.12
    ],
    "text": "Notes:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      62.85,
      518.05,
      547.25,
      541.12
    ],
    "text": "1.Seat Belt -In the case of the seat belt, driver & the front passengers should have three point seatbelt and the other passengers should have minimum two point seat belt where applicable.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      62.85,
      554.05,
      436.8,
      565.12
    ],
    "text": "2.Air Bags-Driver and front passengers should have Standard Air bags",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      62.85,
      578.05,
      505.21,
      589.12
    ],
    "text": "3.ABS-All vehicles should be manufactured with Anti - Locking Breaking System",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
